Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 12:41:04 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] [DSv4.1] Add experimental SM90 mHC overlap opt-in

Reuse the existing coefficient stream path with an explicit Hopper opt-in. Keep SM90 out of the SM100 collective fusion and add dispatch coverage. GPU correctness and performance validation remain pending.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: ahmed xijiaat <52128022+xijiaat@users.noreply.github.com>
